(#1\) FIRST CONTACT SCRIPT \(Avery – Intake\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Live Answer Script) Tj
T*
("Hi, this is Avery with Tomlinson & Co — thanks for your request.) Tj
T*
(Is now a bad time for a quick homeowners quote intake? It should only take 2–3 minutes.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If yes \(good time\):) Tj
T*
("Great. I’ll make this easy. I just need a few details so we can prepare your options.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Core questions \(in order\):) Tj
T*
(1. "Can I confirm your full name?") Tj
T*
(2. "What’s the property address you want quoted?") Tj
T*
(3. "Best email and mobile for quote updates?") Tj
T*
(4. "When does your current policy renew?") Tj
T*
(5. "Who is your current carrier, if you know it?") Tj
T*
(6. "Any recent updates to the home we should consider \(roof, systems, renovations\)?") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Close:) Tj
T*
("Perfect — thank you. We’ll review options and follow up with next steps shortly.) Tj
T*
(Would you prefer text or email for updates?") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##If They’re Busy) Tj
T*
("No problem at all. What’s the best time today for a 2-minute callback?) Tj
T*
(I can also send a quick secure link by text so you can finish when convenient.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##First Contact Voicemail \(30–40 sec\)) Tj
T*
("Hi, this is Avery with Tomlinson & Co.) Tj
T*
(I’m following up on your homeowners quote request and can help you get options quickly.) Tj
T*
(Call or text us back at [NUMBER], and we’ll keep it simple.) Tj
T*
(Again, this is Avery with Tomlinson & Co at [NUMBER].") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
